      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA beautifully presented, A-rated detached home extending to approximately 160 sq.m. (1,730 sq. ft.), No. 27 Chestnut Hill offers contemporary and stylish family living in one of Wexford's highly regarded residential developments.\n\nBuilt in 2021 and presented in excellent condition throughout, this impressive four bedroom, three bathroom home is ready for immediate occupation. The property combines generous proportions with a modern interior, quality finishes and a warm, contemporary feel.\n\nThe welcoming entrance hallway sets the tone, leading into well proportioned living accommodation. At the heart of the home is the impressive kitchen and dining area, featuring a contemporary fitted kitchen with extensive cabinetry, quartz worktops and splashback, integrated appliances and an electric hob and extractor. Sliding doors open directly onto the rear garden, creating an ideal connection between the kitchen and outdoor space. A separate utility room and guest WC complete the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, four generous bedrooms provide excellent family accommodation. The bedrooms are bright and well proportioned, while the modern family bathroom is separate.\n\nExternally, the rear garden is private and well maintained, with a paved patio, lawn, garden shed and finished boundary walls. To the front, a generous paved driveway provides parking for two vehicles, with useful side access also available.\n\nChestnut Hill is an exclusive development of just 46 homes, offering a peaceful residential setting while remaining exceptionally convenient to Wexford Town. Clonard Village, Wexford Retail Park, Whitford House Hotel & Leisure Centre, schools, supermarkets and a wide range of amenities are all within easy reach, with excellent access to the N25, N11 and M11.\n\nFor those who enjoy the outdoors, Johnstown Castle and the Forth Mountain walking trails are approximately 5km away, while Rosslare Strand is approximately 15km from the property.\n\nFive years young, stylishly presented and ready to move into, No. 27 Chestnut Hill offers a superb opportunity to acquire a modern detached family home in a sought after Wexford location.\n\nFeatures\nA-rated, energy efficient home\n4 bedrooms / 3 bathrooms\nApprox. 160.6 sq.m. / 1,730 sq.ft.\nBuilt in 2021\nImmaculately presented throughout\nStylish decorative wall panelling\nHigh-spec kitchen with quartz worktops\nIntegrated appliances\nLuxurious ensuite and family bathroom\nPrivate patio and lawn\nGarden shed\nSide access\nParking for two vehicles\nAir-to-water heating\nWired for EV charging\nFibre broadband available\nExclusive development of only 46 homes\nExcellent access to Wexford Town and N11/N25\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the exceptional quality, presentation and location of this outstanding home."
      },
